Game Introduction
The game adopts a horizontal style graphics design, and you need to control the matchmaker in the game to complete various task challenges. You can constantly adventure through level breaking. As levels increase, the difficulty will also increase. Interested players should download and give it a try!

Game Details
This is a horizontal action challenge game that combines RPG growth elements, controls Matchman to shoot various monsters along the way, collects experience and coins, continuously strengthens oneself, and challenges the most powerful monsters.
In the game, you need to break through various game levels, with different levels having different levels of difficulty. The only way to break through a level is to eliminate all the enemies in the game. Only by eliminating all the enemies can you have a chance to smoothly enter the next level.

Game Features
1. A plethora of levels and weapons;
2. Classic image and rich cultivation elements;
3. Use powerful firepower to maintain an invincible position.

Game evaluation
1. In different game levels, you need to perform various game operations. During this process, you need to command your matchmaker and eliminate other enemies;
2. While performing various operations, you must not forget to always observe the enemy's position, only in this way can you quickly familiarize yourself with the game and understand it thoroughly;
3. You must understand the rules in the game clearly, only then can you master the game and control the game rhythm stably.

Game gameplay
1. Continuously accumulating and mastering game operations through various levels of the game will help you become more proficient in game operations;
2. Continuously familiarize and experience different game operations during the game process, allowing you to have various excellent gaming experiences that do not exceed what you provide;
3. The matchmaker needs to perform various operations in the level, and quick operations can help you pass the level faster.

Happy Diner Story is a delicious, newly designed time management game. Start by running a small restaurant, upgrade your chef, waiters and cooking equipment, open restaurants in every city in the world, and write the story of your culinary empire.
Different from common cooking games, this game simulates the process from cooking to serving, completely simulating the restaurant management gameplay, allowing you to immersively participate in every aspect of cooking. From the moment a customer enters the restaurant, the operation of the restaurant begins. Assigning tables to customers, customers ordering meals, serving snacks to customers, chefs personally cooking for customers, etc., a series of processes will be presented in the game. You can also upgrade waiters and chefs to make them more efficient and faster; upgrade dishes to make the food more delicious; upgrade restaurant equipment to accommodate more customers. Don't miss out on every detail, creating the perfect restaurant starts here.
Game features:
- Newly designed gameplay. Different from traditional cooking games, the immersive simulation will fascinate you;
- Everything can be upgraded. The elements you see: chefs, waiters, equipment, tables and chairs, etc., can all be upgraded to make your cooking process more comfortable;
- Customized decoration. Restore the restaurant's decoration design one-to-one, carefully arrange the restaurant decoration, all the decorations you see have been carefully created by us;
- Surprising props. Want a more enjoyable pass? It doesn't matter, you can use props to make the waiter run faster and satisfy customers' dish requirements at any time. There are also many surprise props waiting for you to discover;
- Rich activities and gameplay. We will regularly open limited-time events and launch limited items in conjunction with current festivals to greatly enrich the game content;
Run your restaurant, discover delicious food from all over the world, and realize your dream of being a chef here.
